# <type>(optional-scope): <short summary>
#
# |<----  Maximum 50 characters  ---->|
#
# Example: feat(parser): add HTTP header parsing
#
# Types:
#   feat:     New feature
#   fix:      Bug fix
#   refactor: Code refactoring (no behavior change)
#   docs:     Documentation updates
#   style:    Code formatting (no logic change)
#   test:     Adding or updating tests
#   chore:    Maintenance tasks
#   perf:     Performance improvements
#   ci:       CI/CD changes
#
# Common Scopes for webserv:
#   parser, server, config, response, request, cgi, 
#   multiplexing, utils, socket, mime, structure, build
#
# Remember:
#   - Use imperative mood: "add" not "added" or "adds"
#   - Capitalize first letter after colon
#   - No period at the end
#   - Body: explain WHY, not WHAT (wrap at 72 characters)
#
# --- COMMIT MESSAGE ABOVE THIS LINE ---
